# Per-run scratch: regenerated by run.sh on every invocation.
work-*/

# Note: the digest.py venv is created at exe/.regression-venv/ (outside
# src/, so build/doc tools that scan src/ never see it) — not here.

# The repo-root .gitignore blanket-ignores `src/tests/**/*.dat` to keep
# research-case output out of git. The committed golden residuals logs ARE
# deliberate regression references — re-include them. Scratch `.dat` files
# stay ignored: they only ever land under work-*/, ignored above.
!*/golden/**/*-residuals.dat
